<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 67 0 R
/T (The application follows a simple layered structure. The CLI layer \(main.py\) handles input/output only. It calls into an agent layer that owns the planning workflow, which in turn uses three focused modules for the Bayesian mastery model, the ML predictor and the search based planner. Persistence and analytics sit alongside as independent modules.)
/E (The application follows a simple layered structure. The CLI layer \(main.py\) handles input/output only. It calls into an agent layer that owns the planning workflow, which in turn uses three focused modules for the Bayesian mastery model, the ML predictor and the search based planner. Persistence and analytics sit alongside as independent modules.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
