/S /H2
/P 67 0 R
/T (The overall pipeline matches the one specified for the project: student data becomes a student state, which feeds the Bayesian mastery model and the ML predictor, which feed the search based planner, which produces a study plan. Recording an assessment result updates the state and triggers a replan.)
/E (The overall pipeline matches the one specified for the project: student data becomes a student state, which feeds the Bayesian mastery model and the ML predictor, which feed the search based planner, which produces a study plan. Recording an assessment result updates the state and triggers a replan.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
