122 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 67 0 R
/T (Data flows in one direction for reads: the CLI asks the agent for a plan, the agent asks the planner, the planner asks the ML predictor for a success probability per topic and reads mastery directly off the topic object. Writes \(recording an assessment\) go agent to mastery module, and the updated state is saved by storage.py after each CLI action.)
/E (Data flows in one direction for reads: the CLI asks the agent for a plan, the agent asks the planner, the planner asks the ML predictor for a success probability per topic and reads mastery directly off the topic object. Writes \(recording an assessment\) go agent to mastery module, and the updated state is saved by storage.py after each CLI action.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
