/T (The search stops once the remaining time in every surviving partial plan is below one slot, or after a maximum number of actions. The highest total utility plan in the final pool is returned along with a trace of the best utility seen at each step, which is shown to the user as the 'search trace' line.)
/E (The search stops once the remaining time in every surviving partial plan is below one slot, or after a maximum number of actions. The highest total utility plan in the final pool is returned along with a trace of the best utility seen at each step, which is shown to the user as the 'search trace' line.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
