250 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 74 0 R
/E (Tests are written with the standard library unittest module and organized by layer: test_mastery.py for the Bayesian update logic, test_planner.py for the utility function and the beam search, and test_agent.py for the orchestration layer and JSON persistence. The ML predictor is trained once per test class \(setUpClass\) against a disposable CSV path so tests do not depend on or modify the bundled dataset.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
251 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 74 0 R
/E (Coverage includes: correct update direction from pass/fail assessments, mastery bounds, uncertainty shrinking with more attempts, the forgetting mechanism pulling mastery back, exam urgency increasing as the exam date approaches, weak topics scoring a higher utility than strong ones, the repetition penalty actually reducing utility, the planner respecting the daily time budget, the planner handling an empty profile without crashing, replanning after new results, invalid subject/topic lookups raising a clear error, and a JSON save/load round trip.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
