259 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 75 0 R
/E (- A small, explainable model \(logistic regression\) combined with a hand designed utility function can produce plans whose reasoning is easy to communicate to the end user, which matters more than squeezing out extra predictive accuracy for a tool like this.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
260 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 75 0 R
/E (- Keeping the ML and search modules free of any storage or CLI dependency made them directly testable and made it straightforward to reuse the same predictor instance across a whole CLI session instead of retraining it on every menu action.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
261 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
