753 0 obj
<<
/Title (- Beam search instead of a full exhaustive search or a greedy pick: a greedy pick can get stuck always picking the single highest utility topic every slot, since the repetition penalty is what prevents that, but a greedy method reacts to the penalty one step late. A full exhaustive search over action sequences grows quickly with the number of topics and slots. Beam search keeps a small set of the most promising partial plans at each step, which is a good middle ground for a CLI tool that has to feel instant.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 732 0 R
/Prev 747 0 R
/Next 748 0 R
>>
endobj
